  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "EOdBXSxtTkHZRLLEfWiy9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 372.1883671061004,
      "y": 147.44739056097285,
      "width": 835.719482421875,
      "height": 1250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 593414854,
      "version": 1079,
      "versionNonce": 489455722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772421891080,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n* Developers can create / update / delete Flags\n* Application can query flags in real time\n* Developers can rollback changes. \n--\n* Developers can see all the history of flag changes\n* Bulk operations\n* Kill switch\n\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n\n* Low latency : As soon as flag is updated I need to see the value in real time <10ms\n* Eventual consistency is accepted ( Availability >> consistency )\n* Reads >> Writes\n* 10k reads/sec \n\n\nEntity\n* Feature Flag\n* Application\n* User\n\nAPI routes\n\nUser id is determined by JWT\n\nPOST /flags/{key}\n{HEADER: JWT}\n{\n    name,\n    type: booleans | string | object\n    value: true | false | config\n}\nresponse \n{\n    status : 200,\n    keyId\n    \n}\n\nGET /flags/{keyId}\n{\n    value: true | false | config\n}\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n* Developers can create / update / delete Flags\n* Application can query flags in real time\n* Developers can rollback changes. \n--\n* Developers can see all the history of flag changes\n* Bulk operations\n* Kill switch\n\n\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n\n* Low latency : As soon as flag is updated I need to see the value in real time <10ms\n* Eventual consistency is accepted ( Availability >> consistency )\n* Reads >> Writes\n* 10k reads/sec \n\n\nEntity\n* Feature Flag\n* Application\n* User\n\nAPI routes\n\nUser id is determined by JWT\n\nPOST /flags/{key}\n{HEADER: JWT}\n{\n    name,\n    type: booleans | string | object\n    value: true | false | config\n}\nresponse \n{\n    status : 200,\n    keyId\n    \n}\n\nGET /flags/{keyId}\n{\n    value: true | false | config\n}\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
