      "updated": 1772355506958,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Potential Issue:\n\nIf only true, false this will work, but in case if we want to store a config as a part of feature flag, things will \nstart going little difficult. \n* How to store a file > 1MB since redis needs a higher file size. \n* What changes we do in postgres we now need some blob storage. \n* How a user can flow of update can change. \n\nLets see if we need to have a config, we can have presigned URL to directly upload to S3. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Potential Issue:\n\nIf only true, false this will work, but in case if we want to store a config as a part of feature flag, things will \nstart going little difficult. \n* How to store a file > 1MB since redis needs a higher file size. \n* What changes we do in postgres we now need some blob storage. \n* How a user can flow of update can change. \n\nLets see if we need to have a config, we can have presigned URL to directly upload to S3. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
