    {
      "id": "Wr5ZRGzs5vATK80cI5JkB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700.38215137986,
      "y": 1237.9558230973803,
      "width": 1831.2388916015625,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1660830170,
      "version": 1014,
      "versionNonce": 1758408938,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772424743189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Write Flow:\n\n1. Client will update flag from UI to write service\n2. Write service will get the presigned URL based on the existing key if not create a new key and new location for s3 \n3. Client will publish a success message on upload finish\n4. Write service will add updatedAt timestamp / audit event etc. \n5. If the key is in redis then it will trigger CDC event to cache invalidation.\n\nRead Flow:\n\n1. Client SDK will have the polling mechanism which will poll every 1s. ( Local cache has the version_id: xx num so read service will check If-None-Match: version_42 then fetch the version ) \n2. app reads from Local cache for the flag. \n3. For local cache refresh, client will read from read service, which will fetch from redis, if not then fetch it from postgres and add it to redis. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Write Flow:\n\n1. Client will update flag from UI to write service\n2. Write service will get the presigned URL based on the existing key if not create a new key and new location for s3 \n3. Client will publish a success message on upload finish\n4. Write service will add updatedAt timestamp / audit event etc. \n5. If the key is in redis then it will trigger CDC event to cache invalidation.\n\nRead Flow:\n\n1. Client SDK will have the polling mechanism which will poll every 1s. ( Local cache has the version_id: xx num so read service will check If-None-Match: version_42 then fetch the version ) \n2. app reads from Local cache for the flag. \n3. For local cache refresh, client will read from read service, which will fetch from redis, if not then fetch it from postgres and add it to redis. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
